notes.content:
Added furniture:​​ Sorting Table. You can now sort parts on the sorting table to craft higher-tier items.

​Added furniture:​​ Sticky Notes. You can now use sticky notes in hideouts to label various furniture for easier categorization.

Added functionality to interact with curtains in random scenes. You can now tear down curtains in scenes to obtain more cloth and brighter environments.

Added inventory sorting functionality.

Added tips to loading screens.

Adjusted save logic to improve save performance.

Improved animation for most character actions.



​Fixed issues where:​​

Dismantling cabinets would cause errors;

Food consumption could trigger incorrect calorie calculations under specific circumstances;

Crosshairs would fail to highlight objects in certain situations;

Various problems in random scenes;

Several issues with workbenches;

Lockpicking volume fluctuating unexpectedly;

Holding multiple items during interactions under specific conditions.

​

Visual improvements:​​

Enhanced animations for some menu buttons

Improved world map interface

Refined certain fonts
